---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "旅行必备中文用语";
const description = "出发前学会这些基础中文用语——包括发音、使用场景和沟通技巧。";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/life/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        返回生活指南
      </a>
    </nav>
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🗣️ 中国生活</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        旅行必备中文用语
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">学会十几个短语，别人对你的态度大不一样。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新：2026 年 6 月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读时间：4 分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-50 to-emerald-50 border-l-4 border-green-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-4">🎯 快速回答</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-green-800 leading-relaxed">
        不会中文也能在中国旅行。但学会十几个短语会让你的旅行体验好得多——当地人真心欣赏你的努力，你会发现服务更周到、笑容更温暖，甚至在市场还能拿到更好的价格。
      </p>
    </div>

    <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📋 本文导读</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#greetings" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">👋 问候与礼貌</a></li>
        <li><a href="#eating" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🍽️ 用餐与点餐</a></li>
        <li><a href="#shopping" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🛍️ 购物与砍价</a></li>
        <li><a href="#getting-around" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🚇 出行问路</a></li>
        <li><a href="#emergencies" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🆘 紧急情况</a></li>
        <li><a href="#pronunciation" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🎵 发音技巧</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 id="greetings" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">👋</span> 问候与礼貌
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">英文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">拼音</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">说明</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Hello</td><td class="px-6 py-4">你好</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Nǐ hǎo</td><td class="px-6 py-4">对谁都能用，随时用</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">Thank you</td><td class="px-6 py-4">谢谢</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Xiè xiè</td><td class="px-6 py-4">多说，人家会注意到</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Sorry / Excuse me</td><td class="px-6 py-4">对不起</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Duì bù qǐ</td><td class="px-6 py-4">不小心撞到人时用</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">It's okay</td><td class="px-6 py-4">没关系</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Méi guān xì</td><td class="px-6 py-4">回应"对不起"</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Goodbye</td><td class="px-6 py-4">再见</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Zài jiàn</td><td class="px-6 py-4">标准道别用语</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12"><strong>小贴士：</strong>每次交易后都说声"谢谢"——在餐厅、商店、出租车上都适用。在日常交往中这句话非常管用。</p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 id="eating" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🍽️</span> 用餐与点餐
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">英文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">拼音</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">说明</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Check, please</td><td class="px-6 py-4">买单</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Mǎi dān</td><td class="px-6 py-4">稍微抬手示意一下</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">Delicious!</td><td class="px-6 py-4">好吃！</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Hǎo chī!</td><td class="px-6 py-4">夸夸厨师</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">No spicy</td><td class="px-6 py-4">不加辣</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Bù jiā là</td><td class="px-6 py-4">在四川/湖南必用</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">Water, please</td><td class="px-6 py-4">请给我水</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Qǐng gěi wǒ shuǐ</td><td class="px-6 py-4">别喝自来水</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 id="shopping" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🛍️</span> 购物与砍价
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">英文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">拼音</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">说明</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">How much?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">多少钱？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Duō shǎo qián?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">万能问价句</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">Too expensive</td><td class="px-6 py-4">太贵了</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Tài guì le</td><td class="px-6 py-4">只在市场用</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Can you lower it?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">便宜一点？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Pián yí yì diǎn?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">市场有用，商店别用</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">I'll take it</td><td class="px-6 py-4">我要这个</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Wǒ yào zhè ge</td><td class="px-6 py-4">决定买了就说</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 id="getting-around" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🚇</span> 出行问路
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">英文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">拼音</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">说明</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Where is...?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">...在哪里？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">...zài nǎ lǐ?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">用中文地名填进去</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">I'm going here</td><td class="px-6 py-4">去这里</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Qù zhè lǐ</td><td class="px-6 py-4">把地址给司机看</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Stop here</td><td class="px-6 py-4">这里停</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Zhè lǐ tíng</td><td class="px-6 py-4">打车时用</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">How long?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">多久？</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Duō jiǔ?</td><td class="px-6 py-4">问路程或等待时间</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12"><strong>老手建议：</strong>给司机看目的地时，一定用中文写地址。</p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 id="emergencies" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🆘</span> 紧急情况
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">英文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">中文</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">拼音</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">说明</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">Help!</td><td class="px-6 py-4">救命！</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Jiù mìng!</td><td class="px-6 py-4">只在真正紧急时用</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">Call the police</td><td class="px-6 py-4">报警</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Bào jǐng</td><td class="px-6 py-4">报警电话：110</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">I need a doctor</td><td class="px-6 py-4">我需要医生</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Wǒ xū yào yī shēng</td><td class="px-6 py-4">急救电话：120</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">I'm lost</td><td class="px-6 py-4">我迷路了</td><td class="px-6 py-4">Wǒ mí lù le</td><td class="px-6 py-4">用中文展示目的地</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 id="pronunciation" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🎵</span> 发音技巧
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">中文有<strong>声调</strong>——同一个音节用不同音高说出来，意思完全不同。不过不用太担心，上下文通常能让人明白你的意思，而且当地人对游客很宽容。</p>

      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">四个声调：</p>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">声调</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">示例</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">含义</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">说明</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">1st</td><td class="px-6 py-4">mā (妈)</td><td class="px-6 py-4">妈妈</td><td class="px-6 py-4">高平调，声音持平</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">2nd</td><td class="px-6 py-4">má (麻)</td><td class="px-6 py-4">麻木</td><td class="px-6 py-4">中升调，声音上扬</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4">3rd</td><td class="px-6 py-4">mǎ (马)</td><td class="px-6 py-4">马匹</td><td class="px-6 py-4">先降后升</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4">4th</td><td class="px-6 py-4">mà (骂)</td><td class="px-6 py-4">骂人</td><td class="px-6 py-4">全降调，声音急降</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12"><strong>最好的建议：</strong>说得慢一点、清楚一点。大多数中国人习惯了外国人声调不标准，会努力去理解你的意思。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">📚 相关攻略</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/zh/life/survival-kit/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100 no-underline">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">🎒 中国行前准备清单</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">出发前的完整准备工作对照表</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/life/essential-apps/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100 no-underline">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">📱 来中国前必下的 10 个 App</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">必备 App，包括翻译工具</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/life/cultural-taboos/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100 no-underline">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">🏮 中国文化禁忌与礼仪</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">自信应对社交场合</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  
    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">参考来源</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600">
        <li>语言参考——无单一官方来源。</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>